    <item>
      <title>读《富爸爸穷爸爸》：房子是资产吗，写代码是事业吗</title>
      <link>https://lyapple2008.github.io/posts/202609/2026-09-03-%E5%AF%8C%E7%88%B8%E7%88%B8%E7%A9%B7%E7%88%B8%E7%88%B8%E8%AF%BB%E5%90%8E%E6%84%9F/</link>
